# ArkhamDB card lookup

When Tyler gives an Arkham collector number (`141`, `#141`, `01141`), fetch the card immediately. Do not ask him to read the card.

```text
scripts/arkham-card 141
```

That script hits `https://arkhamdb.com/api/public/card/{code}`. Use the returned stats, traits, keywords, spawn, victory, and ability text.

Do not bulk-download `/api/public/cards/`. Do not commit API responses, flavor dumps, or images. Do not use the API to reveal unrevealed locations, deck order, or Campaign Guide text.

The physical card still wins if Tyler reports a conflict.
